{% comment %}
  Plain, non-interactive facility badge — per explicit instruction, the
  dropdown/switcher (clinic list, "not available here" Continue/Change
  Clinic warning) is removed entirely. This now just displays either the
  current facility name (In-Clinic) or "Online Consultation" (Video
  Consult), toggled purely by the existing setOnlineHeaderState() in
  kal-booking-flow.js — that function already drives this off the shared
  .kal-step-header__location-text class and the
  data-kal-location-icon-offline/-online pair, both still present here,
  so no JS changes were needed to keep that swap working. Used both for
  the mobile step-header badge (via kal-booking-flow-step-header.liquid)
  and the desktop "Selected Clinic" left-column pill (every other step's
  own liquid), same as before.

  Accepts:
  - location_text: {String} facility name shown in the badge — defaults
    to "Indiranagar" (dummy value, same placeholder used everywhere else
    in this flow until it's wired to a real facility).
  - extra_class: {String} optional, appended to the outer
    .kal-facility-picker wrapper for context-specific styling (e.g.
    Concern Select's desktop pill look), without needing a copy of this
    markup per context.

  Usage:
  {% render 'kal-booking-flow-facility-picker', location_text: 'Indiranagar' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign location_text = location_text | default: 'Indiranagar'
-%}

<div class="kal-facility-picker{% if extra_class %} {{ extra_class }}{% endif %}">
  <div class="kal-step-header__location-badge">
    <span class="kal-step-header__location-badge-left">
      <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
        <span data-kal-location-icon-offline>{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}</span>
        <span data-kal-location-icon-online hidden>{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'mode-online' -%}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="kal-step-header__location-text">{{ location_text }}</span>
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
